  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Shared Handheld",
    "overview": "A modern native launcher with a stronger Pokémon/retro character, as selected by the user. Graphite-teal casing, warm ivory information and compact pixel headings recall a handheld game menu while platform body text keeps German labels readable.\n\nThe interface prioritizes two-player couch use: one coral start action, real ROM/controller/session information, and a consistent gold selection edge. Retro character comes from type, color and original geometric icons; there is no Nintendo artwork or ripped game font.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
